{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/arancia-yards-2-beyond-development-dubailand","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1488,"crm_id":"8454","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Arancia Yards 2","slug":"arancia-yards-2-beyond-development-dubailand","display_address":"City of Arabia","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2029","developer":"Beyond Developments","price":1000000,"display_price":"1M","lattitude":25.083940705711,"longitude":55.327592502249,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":"1,2,3","about":"<p>Arancia Yards 2 at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/dubailand/\">Dubailand</a> is a nature-led residential development by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-beyond/\">Beyond Development</a>, positioned within City of Arabia and The Yards masterplan. Its four buildings offer 1, 2 and 3-bedroom apartments surrounded by landscaped gardens, shaded pathways and a central Green Spine connecting residents to outdoor spaces and everyday conveniences.</p><p>Arancia Yards 2 by Beyond Developments combines lagoon and lounge pools, children’s play areas, residents’ lounges, gyms, yoga spaces, a spa, amphitheatre, cinema room, gaming rooms and multipurpose spaces. With a 10% down payment and a strategic setting near key Dubai destinations, the project presents strong potential for high capital appreciation.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feaure_image_24297caaef.jpg","hash":"Feaure_image_24297caaef","name":"Feaure image.jpg"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Banner_aa1a15235b.jpg","hash":"Banner_aa1a15235b","name":"Banner.jpg"},"media_images":[{"url":"https:/