g heights support comfortable, flexible everyday living.</li><li>Nature-Led Community - Four residential buildings with landscaped gardens, shaded walkways, a sunken garden and shared outdoor spaces.</li><li>Amenity-Rich Green Spine - Pools, sports courts, wellness areas, lounges, cinema and gaming rooms support recreation, relaxation and connection.</li><li>Trusted Developer Vision - Beyond Developments, a premium real estate brand under OMNIYAT Group, focuses on quality, design and nature-led communities.</li><li>Flexible 40/60 Payment Plan - Secure a residence with 10% down and staged construction payments before the final 60% on handover.</li><li>Capital Appreciation Potential - City of Arabia’s connectivity, expanding community infrastructure and lifestyle appeal support prospects for long-term value growth.</li><li>Connected Everyday Living - The Green Spine links homes with wellness, recreation, retail and shared spaces through gardens and walkable pathways.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":2217,"cta":{"id":3050,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Map_c0736b3b7d.jpg","hash":"Map_c0736b3b7d","name":"Map.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"Arancia Yards 2: A Prime Address in Dubailand","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[{"id":105,"place_name":"IMG Worlds of Adventure","time_distance":"3 Minutes"},{"id":106,"place_name":"Global Village","time_distance":"10 Minutes"},{"id":107,"place_name":"Silicon Central Mall","time_distance":"15 Minutes"},{"id":108,"place_name":"Dubai Miracle Garden","time_distance":"16 Minutes"},{"id":109,"place_name":"Hamdan Sports Complex","time_distance":"16 Minutes"},{"id":110,"place_name":"Downtown Dubai","time_distance":"20 Minutes"},{"id":111,"place_name":"Mall of the Emirates","time_distance":"23 Minutes"}],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,