2 at Dubailand by Beyond Developments","canonicalURL":null,"metaDescription":"Explore Arancia Yards 2 at Dubailand by Beyond Developments, featuring well-designed apartments, green spaces and lifestyle amenities."},"more_info":[{"id":10468,"answer":"<p>Arancia Yards 2 is the next residential release within The Yards, featuring four buildings and 370 one, two and three-bedroom apartments surrounded by landscaped communal areas.&nbsp;</p>","question":"What is Arancia Yards 2 by Beyond?"},{"id":10469,"answer":"<p>The development follows a 40/60 payment plan. Buyers pay 10% as a down payment, followed by five construction-stage instalments, with the remaining 60% due on handover.&nbsp;</p>","question":"What is Arancia Yards 2 payment plan?"},{"id":10470,"answer":"<p>Arancia Yards 2 by Beyond Developments combines a connected City of Arabia address, nature-led planning, extensive amenities and flexible purchasing terms. Its position within The Yards will also support long-term demand and capital appreciation.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Why invest in Arancia Yards 2 by BEYOND?"},{"id":10471,"answer":"<p>Arancia Yards Phase 2 is planned for handover in 2029.&nbsp;</p>","question":"What is Arancia Yards 2 completion date?"},{"id":10472,"answer":"<p>Arancia Yards 2 offers 1, 2 and 3-bedroom apartments.&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What property types are available in Arancia Yards 2?"},{"id":10473,"answer":"<p>The Arancia Yards 2 location is within City of Arabia, Dubailand, inside The Yards masterplan and close to IMG World, Global Village and major Dubai destinations.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Where is Arancia Yards 2 located?"}],"virtual_tour_url":null,"permit_number":null,"country":"Dubai","documents":null,"future_launch":null,"adroll":1,"ggfx_results":[{"src_url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Banner_aa1a15235b.jpg","src_cftle":"i/Banner_aa1a15235b.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/376x/